"## Summary\n\nDevstack follow-up 35: F30-01's candidate path, measured on updater 25's lock wait, with every updater invocation's output retained and D-160 in the harness.\n- **Session:** launched 04:17 EST on 2026-11-04 on #463's roadmap row `5c21e670`, and delivered at 05:18.\n- **Model:** codex `gpt-6-astra`.\n- **Size:** 3 commits and 125 owned files, +12,131/−39. Most of it is the run's records under `docs/e2e/runs/2026-11-04/followup35/`.\n  - **The code:** `deploy/devstack/` (a new invocation recorder, `updater-invocation.sh`, and a new admission wrapper, `admission.py`, with the node image and entrypoint wired to them); `mk/e2e.mk`; and in `tests/e2e/`, the timed sections (`timing.go`), the invocation reader (`updater_invocations.go`), the scenario wiring, one evidence-test tightening, and their offline tests.\n- **Checks:**\n  - merge-tree clean on current `main`; prepush-scan clean; owned-check passes.\n  - **The orchestrator reran these** on a scratch tree: current `main` (after #464) with members 22, netlab 36, handover 44 and this branch merged in. All pass:\n    - `make -f mk/e2e.mk e2e-lint` and `make -f mk/at-isolation.mk at-isolation-lint`, since isolation's lint copies the `tests/e2e` Go files;\n    - `go test ./tests/e2e/...`, including `TestD158_TwoUpdaterInvocationOutputsSurvive` and the two `TestD160_` admission tests;\n    - `go vet ./...`;\n    - `go test ./tests/handover/...`, and the committed-evidence tests (`TestCommitted*` in `tests/netlab`, `tests/e2e` and `tests/e2e/at/...`);\n    - `make go-lint`, gofmt and `git diff --check`, and a syntax check of the changed shell and Python files.\n- **Scope:** one full acceptance run, with no rerun and no reservation, after a 660 s preflight wait. No foreign overlap was observed in its five-second samples. Zero owned Docker objects at the end. No AT lane, production code, contract or nightly-list entry changed.\n\n**The orchestrator's reading.**\n- **The run:** `8a436a87`, on `main` after updater